# WN22-AC-000010: Windows Server 2022 account lockout duration must be configured to 15 minutes or greater.
# Source: Windows Server 2022 STIG r8
# Severity: medium
# Generated from 01-extract/output/windows-server-2022-stig-r8-controls.json

META
    esp_id `win2022-wn22-ac-000010-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `windows`
    criticality `high`

    title `Windows Server 2022 account lockout duration must be configured to 15 minutes or greater.`
    description `The account lockout feature, when enabled, prevents brute-force password attacks on the system. This parameter specifies the period of time that an account will remain locked after the specified number of failed logon attempts.`
    author `scanset-security`
    tags `windows,server-2022,stig,medium,account-policy,security-policy,ksi-iam-jit,ksi-iam-sus`

    control_mapping `KSI:KSI-IAM-JIT,KSI:KSI-IAM-SUS,NIST-800-53:AC-7`
    control_objective `KSI-IAM-JIT,KSI-IAM-SUS`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Windows:server-2022:endpoint`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Configure the policy value for Computer Configuration >> Windows Settings >> Security Settings >> Account Policies >> Account Lockout Policy >> Account lockout duration to "15" minutes or greater. A value of "0" is also acceptable, requiring an administrator to unlock the account.`

    component_id `comp-windows-security-policy`

    impl_KSI_IAM_JIT `Windows Server implements KSI-IAM-JIT by enforcing LockoutDuration per the STIG (Account lockout duration must be >= 15 minutes (or 0 for manual unlock).). The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`
    impl_KSI_IAM_SUS `Windows Server implements KSI-IAM-SUS by enforcing LockoutDuration per the STIG (Account lockout duration must be >= 15 minutes (or 0 for manual unlock).). The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`
    impl_AC_7 `Windows Server implements AC-7 by enforcing LockoutDuration per the STIG (Account lockout duration must be >= 15 minutes (or 0 for manual unlock).). The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target
        policy_name `LockoutDuration`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE compliant_1
        exists boolean = true
        value_int int >= 15
    STATE_END

    STATE compliant_2
        exists boolean = true
        value_int int = 0
    STATE_END

    CRI OR
        CTN windows_security_policy
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF compliant_1
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
        CTN windows_security_policy
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF compliant_2
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
